-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":312,"end":369,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-464184c9532df1bb7105","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e0dd257ad16ef2e2076d","layer":"pei","quote":"及恪从合肥还，吴果杀之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":248,"end":259,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-4ce31567282dbe4b94f1","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e0dd257ad16ef2e2076d","layer":"pei","quote":"一旦以女征，去郡，还坐里舍，悒悒躁扰；数为国家，陈击吴、蜀形势","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":160,"end":191,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-b69f7ecbf625030945a2","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3052b426662170cfb2e9","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平中，女为皇后，征拜光禄大夫，位特进","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":39,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-bb3cadce85b6cf752d8d","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-c90b07f2a08d63911d90","layer":"pei","quote":"缉孙殷，晋永兴中，为梁州刺史，见《晋书》。","attribution":"裴注（引书见引句）","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-e76a350246fdc1f4525a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3052b426662170cfb2e9","layer":"original","quote":"缉与中书令李丰同谋，诛","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-fc37e1b3a90212d68d0a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e0dd257ad16ef2e2076d","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军闻恪死，谓众人曰：‘诸葛恪，多辈耳。近张敬仲悬论恪，以为必见杀，今果然如此。敬仲之智，为胜恪也","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":260,"end":310,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q2-9f4fa817ef38eed5bbed","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-e0dd257ad16ef2e2076d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝三﹞《魏略》曰：“缉字敬仲。太和中为温令，名有治能。会诸葛亮出，缉上便宜；诏以问中书令孙资。资以为有筹略，遂召拜骑都尉，遣参征蜀军。军罢，入为尚书郎。以称职为明帝所识。帝以为缉之才能，多所堪任，试呼相者相之。相者云：‘不过二千石。’帝曰：‘何才如是而位（正）〔止〕二千石乎？’及在东莞，领兵数千人。缉性吝于财而矜于势。一旦以女征，去郡，还坐里舍，悒悒躁扰；数为国家，陈击吴、蜀形势。又尝对司马大将军料‘诸葛恪虽得胜所边土，见诛不久’。大将军问其故，缉云：‘威震其主，功盖一国，欲不死，可得乎？’及恪从合肥还，吴果杀之。大将军闻恪死，谓众人曰：‘诸葛恪，多辈耳。近张敬仲悬论恪，以为必见杀，今果然如此。敬仲之智，为胜恪也。’缉与李丰通家，又居相侧近。丰时取急，出，子藐往见之，有所咨道。丰被收，事与缉连，遂收送廷尉；赐死狱中，其诸子皆并诛。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a9d7ae7ce1d2491d51c0","start":0,"end":371,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q2-c881bfc4c8f4878f67bd","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-3052b426662170cfb2e9","layer":"original","quote":"子缉嗣。缉以中书郎稍迁东莞太守〖11〗。嘉平中，女为皇后，征拜光禄大夫，位特进；封妻向为安城乡君。缉与中书令李丰同谋，诛。语在《夏侯玄传》。﹝三﹞","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":185,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-fbfc1f3607c397ecf600","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-cdb3941cc1c8d62840c3","layer":"pei","quote":"恢死后，丰为中书令，父子兄弟皆诛","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":139,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-587a2f820f67ec03079c","start":127,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o061a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-72d2bf4b63ebe87fddd6","layer":"original","quote":"庚戌〖12〗，中书令李丰与皇后父光禄大夫张缉等谋废易大臣〖13〗，以太常夏侯玄为大将军〖14〗。事觉，诸所连及者皆伏诛。辛亥〖15〗，大赦。三月，废皇后张氏。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-91c7db3288e80e5b9e4b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：嘉平六年（公元 254）。己丑：旧历初一日。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":275,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-386affd091adab4ef2df","start":0,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o059","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-83849af55ebd17291970","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月，己丑〖1〗，镇东将军毌丘俭上言：“昔诸葛恪围合肥新城，城中遣士刘整出围〖2〗，传消息，为贼所得。考问所传，语整曰：‘诸葛公欲活汝，汝可具服〖3〗。’整骂曰：‘死狗，此何言也！我当必死为魏国鬼！不苟求活逐汝去也。欲杀我者，便速杀之！’终无他辞。又遣士郑像出城传消息。或以语恪，恪遣马骑寻围迹索，得像还。四五人的头面缚〖4〗，将绕城表。敕语像〖5〗，使大呼，言：‘大军已还洛，不如早降！’像不从其言，更大呼城中曰：‘大军近在围外，壮士努力！’贼以刀筑其口，使不得言。像遂大呼，令城中闻知。整、像为兵，能守义执节，子弟宜有差异〖6〗。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":266,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":271,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o061","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-72d2bf4b63ebe87fddd6","layer":"original","quote":"庚戌〖12〗，中书令李丰与皇后父光禄大夫张缉等谋废易大臣〖13〗，以太常夏侯玄为大将军〖14〗。事觉，诸所连及者皆伏诛。辛亥〖15〗，大赦。三月，废皇后张氏。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0100","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-28be3c298c25640153cc","layer":"pei","quote":"而师以盛年在职，无疾托病，坐拥强兵，无有臣礼；朝臣非之，义士讥之，天下所闻。其罪一也；懿造计取贼，多舂军粮，克期有日。师为大臣，当除国难；又为人子，为当父业。哀声未绝而便罢息，为臣不忠，为子不孝。其罪二也；贼退过东关，坐自起众，三征同进，丧众败绩，历年军实，一旦而尽；致使贼来，天下骚动，死伤流离。其罪三也；贼举国悉众，号五十万，来向寿春，图诣洛阳；会太尉孚与臣等建计，乃杜塞要险，不与争锋，还固新城。淮南将士，冲锋履刃，昼夜相守，勤瘁百日，死者涂地；自魏有军以来，为难苦甚，莫过于此。而师遂意自由，不论封赏，权势自在，无所领录。其罪四也；故中书令李丰等，以师无人臣节，欲议退之。师知而请丰，其夕拉杀，载尸埋棺。丰等为大臣，帝王腹心，擅加酷暴，死无罪名，师有无君之心。其罪五也；懿每叹说齐王自堪人主，君臣之义定。奉事以来十有五载；始欲归政，按行武库，诏问禁兵不得妄出。师自知奸慝，人神所不祐，矫废君主，加之以罪。孚，师之叔父，性甚仁孝，追送齐王，悲不自胜。群臣皆怒而师怀忍，不顾大义。其罪六也；又故光禄大夫张缉，无罪而诛，夷其妻子；并及母后，逼恐至尊，强催督遣，临时哀愕，莫不伤痛；而师称庆，反以欢喜。其罪七也；陛下践阼，聪明神武，事经圣心，欲崇省约，天下闻之，莫不欢庆；而师不自改悔修复臣礼，而方征兵募士，毁坏官内，列侯自卫。陛下即阼，初不朝觐。陛下欲临幸师舍以省其疾，复拒不通，不奉法度。其罪八也；近者领军许允当为镇北，以厨钱给赐；而师举奏加辟，虽云流徙，道路饿杀，天下闻之，莫不哀伤。其罪九也；三方之守，一朝阙废，多选精兵，以自营卫；五营领兵，阙而不补，多载器杖，充聚本营，天下所闻，人怀愤怨，讹言盈路，以疑海内。其罪十也；多休守兵，以占高第，以空虚四表，欲擅强势，以逞奸心；募取屯田，加其复赏，阻兵安忍，坏乱旧法。合聚诸藩王公以著邺，欲悉诛之，一旦举事废主。天不长恶，使目肿，不成。其罪十一也。","attribution":"毌丘俭文钦表","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":118,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6d2d8c49ddd3275ba483","start":0,"end":801,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o099a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b746175fbf5be9cb93b9","layer":"original","quote":"中书令李丰，虽宿为大将军司马景王所亲待〖3〗，然私心在玄〖4〗。遂结皇后父光禄大夫张缉，谋欲以玄辅政。丰既内握权柄，子尚公主；又与缉俱冯翊人，故缉信之。丰阴令弟兖州刺史翼，求入朝；欲使将兵入，并力起。会翼求朝，不听。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o100a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-23e2c5b4fe1020c88bf5","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平六年二月，当拜贵人〖5〗。丰等欲因御临轩〖6〗，诸门有陛兵〖7〗，诛大将军；以玄代之，以缉为骠骑将军。丰密语黄门监苏铄、永宁署令乐敦、冗从仆射刘贤等曰〖8〗：“卿诸人居内，多有不法；大将军严毅，累以为言。张当可以为诫〖9〗！”铄等皆许以从命。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":582,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o101a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-820cad0cf3fc52c5c84b","layer":"original","quote":"大将军微闻其谋〖10〗，请丰相见；丰不知而往，即杀之。﹝三﹞事下有司，收玄、缉、铄、敦、贤等送廷尉。﹝四﹞廷尉钟毓奏：“丰等谋迫胁至尊，擅诛冢宰〖11〗，大逆无道。请论如法〖12〗。”","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":583,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-81b2bba6833a95ef3701","layer":"original","quote":"诏书：“齐长公主先帝遗爱〖20〗，原其三子死命。”于是丰、玄、缉、 〔铄〕 、敦、贤等，皆夷三族；﹝五﹞其余，亲属徙乐浪郡。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":62,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o103b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-81b2bba6833a95ef3701","layer":"original","quote":"玄格量弘济〖21〗，临斩东市〖22〗，颜色不变，举动自若。时年四十六。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p054a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-70d83084548daf5da0b9","layer":"pei","quote":"玄素贵，以爽故，废黜，居常怏怏不得意。中书令李丰，与玄及后父光禄大夫张缉，阴谋为乱；缉与丰同郡，倾巧人也；以东莞太守召，为后家，亦不得意。故皆同谋。初，丰自以身处机密，息韬，又以列侯给事中，尚齐长公主；有内外之重，心不自安。密谓韬曰：‘玄既为海内重人，加以当大任，年时方壮而永见废；又亲曹爽外弟，于大将军有嫌。吾得玄书，深以为忧。缉有才用，弃兵马大郡，还坐家巷。各不得志，欲使汝以密计告之。’缉尝病创，卧，丰遣韬省病。韬屏人语缉曰：‘韬尚公主，父子在机近；大将军秉事，常恐不见明信；太常亦怀深忧。君侯虽有后父之尊，安危未可知；皆与韬家同虑者也，韬父欲与君侯谋之。’缉默然良久曰：‘同舟之难，吾焉所逃？此大事，不捷即祸及宗族！","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":613,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c44e0083c4a365fd5d28","start":10,"end":322,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p054b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-70d83084548daf5da0b9","layer":"pei","quote":"韬于是往报丰，密语黄门监苏铄等。苏铄等答丰：‘惟君侯计。’丰言曰：‘今拜贵人，诸营兵皆屯门。陛下临轩，因此便共迫胁，将群僚人兵，就诛大将军。卿等当共密白此意。’铄等曰：‘陛下傥不从人，奈何？’丰等曰：‘事有权宜！临时若不信听，便当劫将去耳。那得不从！’铄等许诺。丰曰：‘此族灭事，卿等密之！事成，卿等皆当封侯、常侍也。’丰复密以告玄、缉。缉遣子邈与丰相结，同谋起事。","attribution":"《魏书》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":613,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c44e0083c4a365fd5d28","start":323,"end":506,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p055a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-162374bb52fb1597ca0e","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军闻丰谋，舍人王（羕）〔羡〕请以命请丰：‘丰若无备，情屈势迫，必来；若不来，（羕）〔羡〕一人足以制之。若知谋泄，以众挟轮，长戟自卫，径入云龙门；挟天子登凌云台，台上有三千人仗，鸣鼓会众。如此，（羕）〔羡〕所不及也。’大将军乃遣（羕）〔羡〕以车迎之。丰见劫迫，随（羕）〔羡〕而至。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":614,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf13de5cd1b966f56f0e","start":10,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p055b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-162374bb52fb1597ca0e","layer":"pei","quote":"大将军责丰；丰知祸及，遂正色曰：‘卿父子怀奸，将倾社稷。惜吾力劣，不能相擒灭耳！’大将军怒，使勇士以刀环筑丰腰，杀之。","attribution":"《魏氏春秋》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":614,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf13de5cd1b966f56f0e","start":161,"end":220,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p056i-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-876aff4f7f73869ce262","layer":"pei","quote":"景王知其议己，请丰；丰不以实告，乃杀之。其事秘。","attribution":"《魏略》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":615,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-bf13de5cd1b966f56f0e","start":568,"end":592,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o099","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-b746175fbf5be9cb93b9","layer":"original","quote":"中书令李丰，虽宿为大将军司马景王所亲待〖3〗，然私心在玄〖4〗。遂结皇后父光禄大夫张缉，谋欲以玄辅政。丰既内握权柄，子尚公主；又与缉俱冯翊人，故缉信之。丰阴令弟兖州刺史翼，求入朝；欲使将兵入，并力起。会翼求朝，不听。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":581,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":108,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o100","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-23e2c5b4fe1020c88bf5","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平六年二月，当拜贵人〖5〗。丰等欲因御临轩〖6〗，诸门有陛兵〖7〗，诛大将军；以玄代之，以缉为骠骑将军。丰密语黄门监苏铄、永宁署令乐敦、冗从仆射刘贤等曰〖8〗：“卿诸人居内，多有不法；大将军严毅，累以为言。张当可以为诫〖9〗！”铄等皆许以从命。﹝二﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":582,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":126,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o101","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-820cad0cf3fc52c5c84b","layer":"original","quote":"大将军微闻其谋〖10〗，请丰相见；丰不知而往，即杀之。﹝三﹞事下有司，收玄、缉、铄、敦、贤等送廷尉。﹝四﹞廷尉钟毓奏：“丰等谋迫胁至尊，擅诛冢宰〖11〗，大逆无道。请论如法〖12〗。”","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":583,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":92,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o102","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-6ed786fd6b8fbe32a71a","layer":"original","quote":"于是会公卿朝臣，廷议，咸以为：“丰等各受殊宠，典综机密；缉承外戚椒房之尊〖13〗；玄备世臣〖14〗。并居列位〖15〗，而包藏祸心，搆图凶逆；交关阉竖，授以奸计；畏惮天威，不敢显谋，乃欲要君胁上〖16〗，肆其诈虐；谋诛良辅，擅相建立〖17〗；将以倾覆京室〖18〗，颠危社稷。毓所正皆如科律〖19〗，报毓施行。”","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":584,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":154,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o103","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-81b2bba6833a95ef3701","layer":"original","quote":"诏书：“齐长公主先帝遗爱〖20〗，原其三子死命。”于是丰、玄、缉、 〔铄〕 、敦、贤等，皆夷三族；﹝五﹞其余，亲属徙乐浪郡。玄格量弘济〖21〗，临斩东市〖22〗，颜色不变，举动自若。时年四十六。﹝六﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":585,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o108-review-xuan","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e8aa83f31b75ca2487ba","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：夏侯、曹氏，世为婚姻。故惇、渊、仁、洪、休、尚、真等，并以亲旧肺腑〖1〗，贵重于时；左右勋业〖2〗，咸有效劳〖3〗。爽德薄位尊，沉溺盈溢〖4〗；此固大《易》所著〖5〗，道家所忌也〖6〗。玄以规格局度〖7〗，世称其名；然与曹爽中外缱绻〖8〗，荣位如斯；曾未闻匡弼其非，援致良才。举兹以论，焉能免之乎〖9〗？","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":643,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p054","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-70d83084548daf5da0b9","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏书》曰：“玄素贵，以爽故，废黜，居常怏怏不得意。中书令李丰，与玄及后父光禄大夫张缉，阴谋为乱；缉与丰同郡，倾巧人也；以东莞太守召，为后家，亦不得意。故皆同谋。初，丰自以身处机密，息韬，又以列侯给事中，尚齐长公主；有内外之重，心不自安。密谓韬曰：‘玄既为海内重人，加以当大任，年时方壮而永见废；又亲曹爽外弟，于大将军有嫌。吾得玄书，深以为忧。缉有才用，弃兵马大郡，还坐家巷。各不得志，欲使汝以密计告之。’缉尝病创，卧，丰遣韬省病。韬屏人语缉曰：‘韬尚公主，父子在机近；大将军秉事，常恐不见明信；太常亦怀深忧。君侯虽有后父之尊，安危未可知；皆与韬家同虑者也，韬父欲与君侯谋之。’缉默然良久曰：‘同舟之难，吾焉所逃？此大事，不捷即祸及宗族！’韬于是往报丰，密语黄门监苏铄等。苏铄等答丰：‘惟君侯计。’丰言曰：‘今拜贵人，诸营兵皆屯门。陛下临轩，因此便共迫胁，将群僚人兵，就诛大将军。卿等当共密白此意。’铄等曰：‘陛下傥不从人，奈何？’丰等曰：‘事有权宜！临时若不信听，便当劫将去耳。那得不从！’铄等许诺。丰曰：‘此族灭事，卿等密之！事成，卿等皆当封侯、常侍也。’丰复密以告玄、缉。缉遣子邈与丰相结，同谋起事。”《世语》曰：“丰遣子韬，以谋报玄，玄曰‘宜详之耳’，而不以告也。”","attribution":"《魏书》；《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":613,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c44e0083c4a365fd5d28","start":0,"end":540,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
